    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16697" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exclūsĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		excludo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a shutting out</i>, <i>exclusion</i>
			(very rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic.): de exclusione verbum nullum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Eun. 1, 2, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ventorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1,
					6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exceptio est quasi quaedam exclusio, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					44, 1, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
